# Temporary and crash files / 临时文件及崩溃转储
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.pid
*.core
*.dmp
core.[0-9]*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Shared datasets: keep the guide / 统一数据集目录仅跟踪说明
/datasets/**
!/datasets/**/
!/datasets/README.md

# Existing tracked archives stay tracked; .gitignore only excludes new files.
# 已跟踪的实验归档不受影响；本规则仅忽略未跟踪文件。
